  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/resourcepacks/better-bows/logo.webp\" width=\"519\" alt=\"Better Bows Logo\"><br><br>\n  <h2 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:32px\">弓具改進資源包！</h2>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fewanhowell.com%252fresourcepacks%252fbetter-bows\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:40px;color:#1ea1f1;display:block\" rel=\"nofollow\">在我的網站上查看此資源包！</a>\n  <br>\n  <p>此資源包將弓和弩的箭矢重新建模為 3D，就像射出後在遊戲世界中看到的樣子！</p><p>弩也支援顯示 3D 煙火、光靈箭矢與附效箭矢！</p><p>當你裝備多重射擊時，弩上會同時顯示三支箭矢！</p>\n  <br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1293/680/bow-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Bow\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1293/681/crossbow-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Crossbow\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1293/682/ewan-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Aiming Bow\"><br>\n  <br>\n    <div>⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯</div>\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入我的 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fresourcepacks.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入資源包開發 Discord 伺服器！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EwanHowell\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/youtube.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\">在 YouTube 上訂閱！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"https://twitter.com/ewanhowell5195\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/twitter.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#1ea1f1\">在 Twitter 上關注我！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fewanhowell\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/ko-fi.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#17ccff\">在 Ko-fi 上支持我！</p>\n  </a>\n</div>",
